  "_about": "Given names that are forms of one another: a full name and its common short forms and spellings. Two people's records are renderings of one name when their family names match and their given names fall in one group (or one is the other's initial); a name may sit in more than one group (ted is a short form of both edward and theodore). The groups only let a pair be compared: a merge also needs a shared organization, identifier or contact detail, and a person decides it. Names are compared lower-cased and in plain letters.",
